models/th.json is the pretrained Thai phrase-segmentation model from BudouX.

    Upstream:  https://github.com/google/budoux
    Path:      budoux/models/th.json
    Commit:    f43d94cc094e84d26bfeea902ac6adb64f5d7d35
               ("Add Thai language support (#421)", 2023-12-20)
    Licence:   Apache License 2.0 — full text in LICENSE.budoux
    Copyright: Google LLC

The file is vendored verbatim; build.rs only re-encodes it as sorted Rust
tables. src/lib.rs is an independent transcription of BudouX's scoring rule
(Parser.parse) and is licensed Apache-2.0 to match.

To refresh the model:

    curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/budoux/main/budoux/models/th.json \
      -o wasm/thai-segmenter/models/th.json
    mise run build_wasm       # rebuilds docs/thai_segmenter.wasm

`cargo test` asserts the model's weight total (4401); a refreshed model will
fail that assertion until the expected total is updated, which is deliberate —
the number is the fingerprint of the shipped weights.
